OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer says hosting 4G mast is a
OL,4,A'nightmare' as fees cost him thousands
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government's Department for
OL,7,FEnvironment, Food & Rural Affairs
OL,8,F(DEFRA) said its reforms ensured
OL,9,Flandowners were "treated fairly when
OL,10,Fnegotiating with mobile operators".
